'''Atrian Merchants' Causeway''' was a [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]] existing sometime around the [[Imperial Era]]. [[Pirate Queen|Pirate queen]] [[Gunda Mabin]] traveled to its busiest stretch in hopes of saving her [[flagship]] ''[[Bloody Bones]]'' from exploding due to a [[coaxium]] leak.<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

==Behind the scenes==
Atrian Merchants' Causeway was first mentioned in ''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]'', a reference book written by [[Daniel Wallace]] and released in [[2018]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

